usage: investigate_se3_scale.py [-h] [--output OUTPUT]
                                [--screen-count SCREEN_COUNT]
                                [--screen-epochs SCREEN_EPOCHS]
                                [--overfit-epochs OVERFIT_EPOCHS]
                                [--screen-suite {basic,parameterization,spatial}]

CPU-safe, frozen-cache controls for coordinate units and residual updates. No
production model calls, GPU selection, data regeneration or larger training.
Calibration uses only the original 32 overfit training structures. The 128
pilot validation structures are reserved for final paired evaluation.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
  --screen-count SCREEN_COUNT
  --screen-epochs SCREEN_EPOCHS
  --overfit-epochs OVERFIT_EPOCHS
  --screen-suite {basic,parameterization,spatial}
